      "value": "Welp... Looks like the solution to this problem was really simple: Reboot the computer. I'm really not sure WHY that fixed this but after rebooting for an entirely different reason I went to test VRChat because I had an idea of how I might investigate the problem and the problem was completely gone. Go figure. :P\nThis isn't the first time rebooting solved such a weird and highly specific game glitch either so I'm gonna have to remember to try that more often.",
