  "details": "EDIT: Problem Solved! - Solution: Just reboot. Yeah... feeling a little embarased that I didn't try that, but admittedly, glitches which affect very specific things like this often don't trigger my mental \"try rebooting\" alarm. :P\n\nOriginal Details Below\n----------------------------------\n\nVRChat Version: Build 1260\nDescription of the bug: Very simple: I'm locked into holoporting no matter what locomotion setting I choose and I'm getting the tunnel effect as well every time I turn or port, whether I have a tunnel-enabled locomotion mode selected or not.\nI should also note that every attempt I made to change the locomotion mode generated the following messages in my log which may or may not be normal:\n[VRCInputManager] Finger walk mode (#axes) set to: _\nThe _ was either 0, 1, 2, or 3 depending on the mode I was selecting. ALL modes were holoporting with a tunnel effect when moving or turning.\nThis needs to be fixed ASAP.\nSteps to reproduce: Launched the game and was already like that. :(",
